# Real CNIC and selfie images must NEVER be committed.
#
# A CNIC is sensitive personal data under Pakistan's data protection regime,
# and anything that reaches git history is effectively permanent - deleting the
# file later does not remove it from the repository.
#
# Keep real test images in this directory locally; only the example manifests
# (which contain no real values) are tracked.

*
!.gitignore
!*.example.csv
!README.md
